{"license":"CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Institutions for Collective Action: Kroniek van een Bazenbondje, interview met Annie Swart"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:112587"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"E. J. de Jager"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Reis van de Razzia"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"E. J. de Jager MA"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Erik J. de Jager Documentary Films & Projects"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Annie Swart, geboren in 1925, groeide op in Schellingwoude in een boerengezin. Haar grootvader was ook boer en mede-oprichter van de Boerenleenbank in Nieuwendam aan de Nieuwendammerdijk. Later nam een zoon, een oom van Annie, zijn rol in het bestuur over. Na verschillende baantjes gehad te hebben ging Annie in 1962 bij de bank werken als cassière.<br>Mevrouw Swart vertelt over opgroeien in Schellingwoude, over de Tweede Wereldoorlog en over het werken bij de Boerenleenbank in een tijd dat de klanten nog persoonlijk contact hadden met de medewerkers. Mevrouw Swart vertelt dat de medewerkers een biografie kregen over het leven van Raiffeisen, om te weten waar de bank vandaan kwam en welke doelstellingen door de bank werden uitgedragen.<br>Dit interview is opgenomen om de context te schetsen van de co-operatieve vereniging Ons Belang, waarvan veel leden lid van de Boerenleenbank waren vanaf het jaar van oprichting van de bank in 1910.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oral history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"geschiedenis"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"cultureel erfgoed"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"coöperatieve verenigingen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"commons"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"broodfonds"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"arbeidsongeschiktheidsverzekering"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"zelfstandig ondernemen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"zzp-er"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"producer","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"producerName":{"typeName":"producerName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Erik J. de Jager MA"},"producerAffiliation":{"typeName":"producerAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClas